# MARGINAL EFFECT OF THIS PATCH, measured interleaved (this is the number to quote):
#   analysis/ab/run_ab.sh, A B A B, four fresh servers, three runs each, position-matched.
#   A = pristine pa_ragged.py at base commit, B = this patch. Patches 1 and 3 present and
