#
#     position     A (GOLDEN)   B (EXPERIMENTAL)   delta    median ITL
#     r1 run1       1925.774        1980.375      +2.84%      -4.12%
#     r1 run2       1923.001        1983.105      +3.13%      -4.26%
#     r1 run3       1918.098        1973.383      +2.88%      -4.17%
